1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,244
20 July 2026.

2
00:00:01,244 --> 00:00:04,305
Sansad ki taraf badhta ek march.

3
00:00:04,305 --> 00:00:06,410
Aur saamne, aansu gas.

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:11,853
Do din baad, Delhi High Court ne
Kendra aur Delhi Police ko

5
00:00:11,853 --> 00:00:17,100
notice bheja, aur kaha, saare video
saboot sambhaal kar rakho.

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:22,323
Police ka kehna tha, pattharbaazi
aur todphod hui, paanch FIR

7
00:00:22,323 --> 00:00:26,940
darj huin, aur sab kuch peshewar
tareeke se sambhaala gaya.

8
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,518
Maamla adaalat mein hai.

9
00:00:29,518 --> 00:00:32,090
Par ye tasveer nayi nahi hai.

10
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:35,342
Olympic medal jeetne waale pehalwaan.

11
00:00:35,342 --> 00:00:37,538
Library mein padhte chhaatra.

12
00:00:37,538 --> 00:00:39,204
Dangon mein jale ghar.

13
00:00:39,204 --> 00:00:41,930
Border par ek ikkees saal ka kisaan.

14
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,575
Har baar ek hi sawaal.

15
00:00:44,575 --> 00:00:47,868
Police kiske liye kaam karti hai?

16
00:00:47,868 --> 00:00:49,664
Qaanoon ke liye...

17
00:00:49,664 --> 00:00:51,360
ya satta ke liye?

18
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,194
Is film mein jo saabit hai,
use saabit kahenge.

19
00:00:57,194 --> 00:00:59,432
Jo aarop hai, use aarop.

20
00:00:59,432 --> 00:01:03,070
Aur har kahaani mein, doosra paksh bhi.

21
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,499
Pehle ek buniyaadi baat.

22
00:01:05,499 --> 00:01:08,220
Police kiske hukm par chalti hai?

23
00:01:08,670 --> 00:01:11,844
Samvidhaan mein police
raajyon ka vishay hai.

24
00:01:11,844 --> 00:01:14,384
Yaani zyaadatar raajyon mein, police

25
00:01:14,384 --> 00:01:17,840
Mukhyamantri aur raajya ke
Grih Vibhaag ke tahat.

26
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:19,898
Par Dilli alag hai.

27
00:01:19,898 --> 00:01:23,537
Delhi Police, Dilli
Sarkaar ke nahi, Kendra

28
00:01:23,537 --> 00:01:27,260
Sarkaar ke Grih Mantralay
ke tahat aati hai.

29
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:34,530
2014 se Kendra mein BJP ki sarkaar hai,
aur 2019 se Grih Mantri Amit Shah.

30
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:39,316
To is film ki Dilli waali har
kahaani mein, prashaasanik

31
00:01:39,316 --> 00:01:43,730
zimmedaari ki aakhiri kadi,
Kendra ka Grih Mantralay hai.

32
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,393
Par dhyaan rahe.

33
00:01:45,393 --> 00:01:49,107
Prashaasanik zimmedaari,
seedha aadesh nahi hoti.

34
00:01:49,107 --> 00:01:54,640
Kisi mantri ne laathi chalaane ko kaha,
aisa koi saboot humein nahi mila.

35
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:58,510
Sawaal aadesh ka nahi, jawaabdehi ka hai.

36
00:01:58,510 --> 00:02:01,930
Aur uske liye chaliye, sabooton ki taraf.

37
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:03,382
January 2023.

38
00:02:03,382 --> 00:02:07,930
Jantar Mantar par desh ke bade
pehalwaan dharne par baithe.

39
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:11,780
Aarop, Kushti Mahasangh ke
tab ke adhyaksh, BJP

40
00:02:11,780 --> 00:02:14,529
saansad Brij Bhushan Sharan Singh par.

41
00:02:14,529 --> 00:02:17,350
Mahila pehalwaanon ke yaun utpeedan ka.

42
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:21,755
April mein police ko likhit
shikaayat di gayi.

43
00:02:21,755 --> 00:02:23,646
FIR phir bhi nahi hui.

44
00:02:23,646 --> 00:02:29,320
Pehalwaan Supreme Court gaye, tab
jaakar 28 April ko FIR darj hui.

45
00:02:29,770 --> 00:02:31,719
Phir aaya 28 May 2023.

46
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,933
Nayi Sansad ka udghaatan.

47
00:02:33,933 --> 00:02:39,160
Aur usi din pehalwaan, Sansad ki
taraf march ke liye nikle.

48
00:02:39,610 --> 00:02:41,841
Barricade par dhakka-mukki hui.

49
00:02:41,841 --> 00:02:45,800
Olympic medalist, kheench kar
buson mein le jaaye gaye.

50
00:02:46,250 --> 00:02:51,150
Usi shaam Jantar Mantar ka dharna
sthal khaali kara diya gaya.

51
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:55,768
Police ke mutaabik saat sau
log hiraasat mein liye

52
00:02:55,768 --> 00:02:59,270
gaye, aur sabko shaam tak chhod diya gaya.

53
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:04,340
Aur pehalwaanon par danga karne
samet kai dhaaraon mein FIR.

54
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:07,342
Police ka daava, unhone barricade tode.

55
00:03:07,342 --> 00:03:09,960
Bajrang Punia ne isse inkaar kiya.

56
00:03:10,410 --> 00:03:14,488
Yaani jin par yaun utpeedan
ka aarop tha, un

57
00:03:14,488 --> 00:03:18,288
par FIR ke liye Supreme Court jaana pada.

58
00:03:18,288 --> 00:03:23,200
Aur jinhone aarop lagaaya, un
par FIR ek hi din mein.

59
00:03:24,450 --> 00:03:26,218
Adaalat mein kya hua?

60
00:03:26,218 --> 00:03:30,850
May 2024 mein court ne Brij
Bhushan par aarop tay kiye.

61
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:34,936
Naabaalig pehalwaan waala
POCSO case, shikaayat

62
00:03:34,936 --> 00:03:38,340
waapas hone ke baad, May
2025 mein band hua.

63
00:03:38,790 --> 00:03:43,099
Aur reporton ke mutaabik, 3
August 2026 ko adaalat

64
00:03:43,099 --> 00:03:46,890
ne unhe baaki maamle mein
bhi bari kar diya.

65
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:50,173
Adaalat ka faisla sir aankhon par.

66
00:03:50,173 --> 00:03:56,090
Par ye film faisle par nahi, police ke
bartaav par sawaal poochhti hai.

67
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:59,130
Medal jeetkar laute to salaam.

68
00:03:59,130 --> 00:04:01,030
Insaaf maanga, to bus.

69
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,690
15 December 2019.

70
00:04:03,690 --> 00:04:06,536
Naagrikta qaanoon ke khilaaf pradarshan.

71
00:04:06,536 --> 00:04:08,670
Dilli ki Jamia Millia Islamia.

72
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:12,580
Shaam ko pradarshan hinsak
hua, basein jaleen.

73
00:04:12,580 --> 00:04:14,460
Police campus mein ghusi.

74
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:19,107
Police ne kaha, wo upadraviyon
ka peechha kar rahi

75
00:04:19,107 --> 00:04:22,800
thi, aur library mein
ghusne se inkaar kiya.

76
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:28,590
Do mahine baad, February 2020 mein,
library ka CCTV saamne aaya.

77
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:34,590
Footage mein, reading room mein baithe
chhaatron par laathiyaan chalti dikhti hain.

78
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:41,608
Police se jude ek video mein daava hua,
chhaatron ke haath mein patthar the.

79
00:04:41,608 --> 00:04:47,830
Baad mein ek padtaal mein paaya gaya, wo
darwaaza mezon se rok rahe the.

80
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:50,775
Maanavaadhikaar Aayog ki report aayi.

81
00:04:50,775 --> 00:04:54,011
Usne library mein
laathicharge ko taala ja sakne

82
00:04:54,011 --> 00:04:57,450
waala, aur police ki
ghair-zimmedaar kaarvaai kaha.

83
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:03,154
Par usi report ne ye bhi kaha,
pradarshan bina ijaazat tha,

84
00:05:03,154 --> 00:05:08,140
hinsak tha, aur iske peechhe ke
asli logon ki jaanch ho.

85
00:05:08,590 --> 00:05:14,140
Aayog ne kaha, library mein laathi chalaane
waale pulisakarmiyon ki pehchaan ho.

86
00:05:14,590 --> 00:05:16,439
Kareeb saat saal ho gaye.

87
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:21,840
Kisi pulisakarmi par kaarvaai ka koi
saarvajanik record humein nahi mila.

88
00:05:22,290 --> 00:05:26,652
Aur October 2026 mein Delhi High
Court ne, Jamia aur Dilli

89
00:05:26,652 --> 00:05:31,240
dangon ki swatantra jaanch ki
yaachikaayein khaarij kar deen.

90
00:05:31,690 --> 00:05:32,855
February 2020.

91
00:05:32,855 --> 00:05:34,435
Uttar-poorvi Dilli.

92
00:05:34,435 --> 00:05:35,933
Teen din ki hinsa.

93
00:05:35,933 --> 00:05:37,680
Tirpan logon ki maut.

94
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:40,976
Saikdon case darj hue.

95
00:05:40,976 --> 00:05:43,830
Jaanch Delhi Police ke haath mein.

96
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:47,506
Ab adaalaton ke faisle aane lage hain.

97
00:05:47,506 --> 00:05:51,750
Aur kai faislon mein, sawaal
police ki jaanch par.

98
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:56,205
Indian Express ne bari hone
ke 93 faisle padhe.

99
00:05:56,205 --> 00:06:01,000
17 mein adaalat ne gadhe hue saboot ya
gambhir gadbadi ki baat kahi.

100
00:06:02,450 --> 00:06:08,462
Ek case mein adaalat ne police ke daavon
mein banaavatipan ki baat kahi.

101
00:06:08,462 --> 00:06:12,470
Ek aur mein, aagzani ke case
ko jhootha bataaya.

102
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:18,040
2021 mein Karkardooma Court ke ek
judge ne likha, jab itihaas in

103
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:22,520
dangon ko dekhega, to jaanch
agency ki naakaami dikhegi.

104
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:30,390
October 2021 mein, High Court ke ek routine
tabaadle mein, unka transfer ho gaya.

105
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:35,210
Delhi Police kehti hai, uski
jaanch poori imaandaari

106
00:06:35,210 --> 00:06:39,160
se hui, aur kai maamlon mein
sazaa bhi hui hai.

107
00:06:39,610 --> 00:06:44,125
Aur High Court ne October 2026
mein kaha, aisa koi saboot

108
00:06:44,125 --> 00:06:48,560
nahi ki jaanch sansthaagat taur
par samjhaute waali thi.

109
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:51,572
Court ke saamne aankde the.

110
00:06:51,572 --> 00:06:53,660
22 maamlon mein sazaa.

111
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:54,988
108 mein bari.

112
00:06:54,988 --> 00:06:57,550
16 mein aarop hi nahi tike.

113
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:01,114
Yaani adaalat ne saazish nahi maani.

114
00:07:01,114 --> 00:07:07,170
Par bari hue logon ne saalon muqadma
jhela, aur kai ne jail bhi kaati.

115
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:08,596
Sawaal wahi.

116
00:07:08,596 --> 00:07:12,419
Jab adaalat khud sabooton ko
gadha hua kahe, to

117
00:07:12,419 --> 00:07:15,510
gadhne waale par kaarvaai kaun karega?

118
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,025
February 2024.

119
00:07:18,025 --> 00:07:23,580
Kisaan, fasal ke daam ki qaanooni
guarantee maangne Dilli ki taraf nikle.

120
00:07:24,030 --> 00:07:27,891
Haryana ki BJP sarkaar ne
Shambhu aur Khanauri

121
00:07:27,891 --> 00:07:31,500
par, Punjab ki seema par,
raasta band kiya.

122
00:07:31,950 --> 00:07:35,225
Drone se aansu gas ke gole giraaye gaye.

123
00:07:35,225 --> 00:07:39,074
Amnesty ke mutaabik, police
sootron ne hi chhah

124
00:07:39,074 --> 00:07:43,250
ghante mein saadhe chaar
hazaar golon ki baat kahi.

125
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:46,759
Police ka kehna tha, pradarshankaariyon ne

126
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:49,890
patthar phenke, aur kai
jawaan ghaayal hue.

127
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:51,308
21 February.

128
00:07:51,308 --> 00:07:52,034
Khanauri.

129
00:07:52,034 --> 00:07:55,260
Ikkees saal ke Shubhkaran Singh ki maut.

130
00:07:57,210 --> 00:07:58,497
Goli kiski thi?

131
00:07:58,497 --> 00:08:01,327
Haryana ne zimmedaari nahi maani.

132
00:08:01,327 --> 00:08:05,530
Aur Punjab mein FIR bhi hafte
bhar baad darj hui.

133
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:09,898
Tab Punjab aur Haryana High
Court ne kaha, dono

134
00:08:09,898 --> 00:08:13,650
raajyon ke paas chhupaane
ko bahut kuchh hai.

135
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:19,202
Court ne retired judge ki aguvaai
mein jaanch committee banaayi.

136
00:08:19,202 --> 00:08:22,630
Supreme Court ne us par
rok se inkaar kiya.

137
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,035
Paune teen saal ho gaye.

138
00:08:25,035 --> 00:08:29,270
Antim report saarvajanik hui,
aisa humein nahi mila.

139
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,628
Ek border.

140
00:08:30,628 --> 00:08:31,900
Do sarkaarein.

141
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:33,625
Do alag paartiyaan.

142
00:08:33,625 --> 00:08:36,350
Aur jawaab, kisi ke paas nahi.

143
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:40,498
Ab thaane ke andar chalte hain.

144
00:08:40,498 --> 00:08:42,500
Jahaan camere kam hain.

145
00:08:42,950 --> 00:08:45,388
Maanavaadhikaar Aayog ke aankde.

146
00:08:45,388 --> 00:08:47,598
Police hiraasat mein mautein.

147
00:08:47,598 --> 00:08:48,894
2021-22 mein 176.

148
00:08:48,894 --> 00:08:50,189
2022-23 mein 163.

149
00:08:50,189 --> 00:08:51,485
2023-24 mein 157.

150
00:08:51,485 --> 00:08:52,780
2024-25 mein 140.

151
00:08:53,230 --> 00:08:54,740
Aankda ghata hai.

152
00:08:54,740 --> 00:09:00,070
Par har saal, ausatan har teesre
din, hiraasat mein ek maut.

153
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:02,849
Har maut apraadh nahi hoti.

154
00:09:02,849 --> 00:09:05,264
Kuchh beemaari se hoti hain.

155
00:09:05,264 --> 00:09:09,060
Par sach jaanne ke liye,
jaanch zaroori hai.

156
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:10,375
Aur sazaa?

157
00:09:10,375 --> 00:09:15,826
NCRB ke aankdon par bani reporton ke
mutaabik, 2018 ke baad kai

158
00:09:15,826 --> 00:09:21,450
saal, hiraasat mein maut ke liye ek
bhi pulisvaale ko sazaa nahi.

159
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:26,320
Ye sirf ek party ki kahaani nahi hai.

160
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:28,922
Uttar Pradesh, BJP sarkaar.

161
00:09:28,922 --> 00:09:33,545
Police ke apne aankdon ke
mutaabik, 2017 se July 2025 tak,

162
00:09:33,545 --> 00:09:37,450
kareeb pandrah hazaar
encounter, aur 238 mautein.

163
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:43,004
Sarkaar kehti hai, ye hathiyaarband
apraadhiyon par jawaabi kaarvaai thi.

164
00:09:43,004 --> 00:09:46,220
Aalochak ise bina muqadme ki
sazaa kehte hain.

165
00:09:46,670 --> 00:09:48,954
Telangana, tab ki TRS sarkaar.

166
00:09:48,954 --> 00:09:54,360
2019 mein balaatkaar ke chaar aaropi,
police encounter mein maare gaye.

167
00:09:54,810 --> 00:09:58,798
Supreme Court ke banaaye aayog
ne use farzi bataaya,

168
00:09:58,798 --> 00:10:02,480
aur das pulisvaalon par
muqadme ki sifaarish ki.

169
00:10:02,930 --> 00:10:04,151
Tamil Nadu, 2020.

170
00:10:04,151 --> 00:10:05,731
Tab ki AIADMK sarkaar.

171
00:10:05,731 --> 00:10:11,260
Sathankulam thaane mein pita-putra, Jayaraj
aur Bennix ki hiraasat mein maut.

172
00:10:11,710 --> 00:10:13,176
CBI ne jaanch ki.

173
00:10:13,176 --> 00:10:16,971
Aur 2026 mein, adaalat ne
nau pulisvaalon ko

174
00:10:16,971 --> 00:10:20,680
doshi thehraaya, aur maut
ki sazaa sunaayi.

175
00:10:21,130 --> 00:10:24,925
Aur 2025 mein, DMK sarkaar
ke rehte, Sivaganga

176
00:10:24,925 --> 00:10:28,142
mein Ajith Kumar ki hiraasat mein maut.

177
00:10:28,142 --> 00:10:32,020
Mukhyamantri ne maafi
maangi, case CBI ko gaya.

178
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:34,184
BJP ho ya vipaksh.

179
00:10:34,184 --> 00:10:38,660
Jiske haath mein police hai,
sawaal usi se hai.

180
00:10:39,110 --> 00:10:40,470
Farq bas itna hai.

181
00:10:40,470 --> 00:10:45,002
Sathankulam mein sazaa tak
pahunche, kyonki jaanch swatantra

182
00:10:45,002 --> 00:10:48,930
agency ko gayi, aur adaalat ne
dabaav banaaye rakha.

183
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:51,469
Yaani jawaabdehi mumkin hai.

184
00:10:51,469 --> 00:10:54,080
Bas system use aasaan nahi banaata.

185
00:10:55,330 --> 00:11:00,230
Aur ye baat Supreme Court bees
saal pehle keh chuka hai.

186
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,684
2006, Prakash Singh case.

187
00:11:02,684 --> 00:11:05,170
Police sudhaar ke saat nirdesh.

188
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:09,533
Police par raajnaitik dabaav rokne
ke liye Suraksha Aayog.

189
00:11:09,533 --> 00:11:11,017
DGP ka tay kaaryakaal.

190
00:11:11,017 --> 00:11:13,310
Jaanch aur qaanoon-vyavastha alag.

191
00:11:13,310 --> 00:11:17,560
Aur police ke khilaaf shikaayat ke
liye swatantra Praadhikaran.

192
00:11:18,010 --> 00:11:22,844
Pandrah saal baad, 2021 mein,
ek report ne paaya, ek

193
00:11:22,844 --> 00:11:27,400
bhi raajya poori tarah in par
amal nahi kar raha.

194
00:11:27,850 --> 00:11:29,423
BJP ke raajya bhi.

195
00:11:29,423 --> 00:11:31,345
Vipaksh ke raajya bhi.

196
00:11:31,345 --> 00:11:35,540
Police par control chhodna,
kisi ko pasand nahi.

197
00:11:35,990 --> 00:11:40,040
Qaanoon ki kitaab mein aapke
adhikaar saaf likhe hain.

198
00:11:40,490 --> 00:11:41,651
Anuchchhed 19.

199
00:11:41,651 --> 00:11:45,630
Shaanti se, bina hathiyaar,
ikattha hone ka haq.

200
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,325
Anuchchhed 21.

201
00:11:47,325 --> 00:11:50,082
Jeevan aur niji aazaadi ka haq.

202
00:11:50,082 --> 00:11:53,550
Jo thaane ke andar bhi khatm nahi hota.

203
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,086
Anuchchhed 22.

204
00:11:55,086 --> 00:11:59,510
Giraftaari ki vajah jaanne,
vakeel se milne, aur chaubees

205
00:11:59,510 --> 00:12:03,390
ghante mein magistrate ke
saamne pesh hone ka haq.

206
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:06,308
Aur 1996 ka D K Basu faisla.

207
00:12:06,308 --> 00:12:11,950
Har giraftaari ka memo, parivaar ko
soochna, aur medical jaanch.

208
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:17,784
Police ko laathi isliye mili, ki wo
qaanoon ki hifaazat kare.

209
00:12:17,784 --> 00:12:19,020
Satta ki nahi.

210
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:24,845
Kyonki jis din vardi, sawaal
poochhne waalon se darne

211
